---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { correctionUrl } from '../lib/data.ts';
---
<Base title="Terms of use" description="The terms for reading, reusing and contributing to the FALK Index.">
  <header class="doc-head" data-rise>
    <div>
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="lead">By using this site, or sending a correction or other contribution, you agree to these terms. Last updated 3 November 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Who publishes FALK</h2>
    <p class="body">The FALK Index is published by Falk Watches, LLC, a Virginia limited liability company, referred to in these terms as "the publisher" or "FALK". The publisher is a watch retailer and sells many of the brands covered here; see <a href="/about/">About</a>. Address: 3130 Fairview Park Dr Ste 210, Falls Church, VA 22042. Contact: <a href="mailto:ethan@falkwatches.com">ethan@falkwatches.com</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Provisional research, not advice</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p>FALK records are provisional research judgments based on the sources each record cites. They are not professional, legal, financial or buying advice, and not a verdict on the quality, value or authenticity of any watch or company.</p>
      <p>Statements on a record report what a cited source says. FALK does not inspect watches or factories and cannot guarantee that a source, or our reading of it, is correct, complete or current. Check the sources before relying on a record.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Limit of liability</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p>The site and data are provided "as is", without warranties of any kind. To the fullest extent the law allows, the publisher is not liable for any loss or damage arising from use of, or reliance on, the site or its data, including indirect or consequential loss.</p>
      <p>Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Your contributions</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p>When you send a correction, evidence, photograph or other contribution to the records, you confirm you have the right to share it, and you license it to FALK and everyone else under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, the licence the data is already published under. Editors may edit, combine, decline or remove contributions.</p>
      <p>If someone brings a claim against FALK because your contribution broke these terms, you agree to cover the resulting losses and reasonable legal costs, to the extent the law allows.</p>
      <p>Contact details you give with a correction are kept private for editors and are not part of the published contribution.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>The forum</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Forum posts are the views of the people who write them, not of FALK or its publisher. They are not FALK records, and they are not part of the published dataset.</p>
      <p>You keep ownership of what you post, and you confirm you have the right to share it. You give the publisher a worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive licence to host, copy and display it as part of the forum, including after you delete your account. These terms, including the promise above to cover losses, apply to forum posts as well.</p>
      <p>Moderators can hide posts and threads and lock threads. Hidden material is kept in our records rather than deleted, and is no longer shown to readers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p>Do not submit material that is false or misleading on purpose, infringes someone else's rights, is unlawful, abusive or spam, or contains other people's personal information. Do not try to disrupt the site, get around its limits, or access accounts or data that are not yours. Automated reading of the public pages is fine at a polite rate; the full dataset is on the <a href="/data/">data page</a>.</p>
      <p>We may moderate, edit or remove any contribution, and suspend or close any account, at our discretion.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Minimum age</h2>
    <p class="body">You must be at least 13 to create an account or send a contribution, or 16 if you live in the European Union or the United Kingdom. FALK does not knowingly collect personal information from anyone younger; if you believe a child has sent us theirs, email <a href="mailto:ethan@falkwatches.com">ethan@falkwatches.com</a> and we will delete it.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Brands and right of reply</h2>
    <p class="body">A brand or watchmaker that disputes a record can reply with evidence through the <a href={correctionUrl()}>correction form</a>. See <a href="/about/">About</a> for how replies are handled.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Trademarks</h2>
    <p class="body">Brand, company and model names belong to their owners and appear here only to identify the watches and companies a record describes. Their appearance does not mean those brands endorse or sponsor FALK or its records.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Legal notices</h2>
    <p class="body">Send legal notices, including trademark and defamation complaints, to Falk Watches, LLC at <a href="mailto:ethan@falkwatches.com">ethan@falkwatches.com</a> or 3130 Fairview Park Dr Ste 210, Falls Church, VA 22042. Include the address of the page concerned, the statement or material you object to, why you object and how to reach you.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Copyright</h2>
    <div class="body">
      <p>The CC BY-SA 4.0 licence covers FALK's own data and writing. Quoted excerpts and images from other sources remain with their owners and are not licensed by FALK.</p>
      <p>If you believe material on this site infringes your copyright, email <a href="mailto:ethan@falkwatches.com">ethan@falkwatches.com</a> with: the work concerned; the address of the material on this site; your name, postal address, phone number and email; a statement that you believe in good faith the use is not authorised by the owner, its agent or the law; a statement, under penalty of perjury, that your notice is accurate and that you are the owner or authorised to act for the owner; and your physical or electronic signature.</p>
      <p>We will remove or disable material when we receive a complete notice, and tell the contributor if there is one. A contributor who believes the removal was a mistake can send a counter-notice to the same address, with the details required by 17 U.S.C. § 512(g). We close the accounts of repeat infringers.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p class="body">These terms are governed by the laws of the Commonwealth of Virginia, without regard to its conflict-of-laws rules. They do not remove any rights your local law gives you that cannot be waived.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-row" data-rise>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p class="body">These terms may change. The version on this page applies; continued use after a change means you accept it.</p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .body { font: 400 18px/1.62 var(--f-serif); max-width: var(--measure); }
  .body > * + * { margin-top: var(--s-4); }
</style>
